# Both models are reached through the OpenRouter Decisions API, so one key is
# enough. One endpoint keeps the network path the same for both models, which
# is what makes their latency comparable (see battleship-vs-jev docs/results-clef.md).
# Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Optional: path to the Stockfish binary. Default: `stockfish` on PATH
# (brew install stockfish).
# STOCKFISH_PATH=/opt/homebrew/bin/stockfish
